  "descriptionHtml": "<p>Crafted in Saffiano leather with a zip top and interior and exterior pockets, our large swingpack crossbody is slim, hands-free and made for moving through your day with intention—part of our On Purpose collection, which is made by a group of 200+ talented artisans from Abahizi Rwanda. An employee-owned and B Corp certified supplier, Abahizi empowers the women who work there through full-time employment, mental health and well-being support, and health care for each employee and her family.</p>\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin-top: 1.5rem;\">\n<h4 style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\">Specifications & Details</h4>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: none; padding-left: 0; font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.6;\">\n<li><strong>Material:</strong> Saffaino Leather</li>\n<li><strong>Lining:</strong> Two way script logo lining</li>\n<li><strong>Shoulder Strap Drop:</strong> Strap drop: 22&quot;</li>\n<li><strong>Pockets:</strong> Interior back zip and front slip pockets</li>\n<li><strong>Drop:</strong> Drop in top zip closure, Drop in top zipper closure</li>\n<li><strong>Bag Dimensions:</strong> 10.2&quot; (L) x 9.52&quot; (H) x 2.92&quot; (W)</li>\n</ul>\n</div>",
